1
00:00:00,725 --> 00:00:03,595
(Leonard:)When did we get
a wall safe?

2
00:00:03,594 --> 00:00:07,934
(Sheldon:)When there was no more room
in the floor safe.

3
00:00:07,932 --> 00:00:10,732
(Leonard:)When did we get
a floor safe?

4
00:00:10,735 --> 00:00:13,705
(Sheldon:)When we got the security camera.

5
00:00:13,705 --> 00:00:15,935
(Leonard:)There's a
security camera?

6
00:00:16,908 --> 00:00:19,878
(Sheldon:)Aquaman, protecting your home
since 2012.

7
00:00:21,846 --> 00:00:24,876
(Penny:)Oh, my God.
We've done things on that couch.

8
00:00:24,882 --> 00:00:26,712
(Sheldon:)Yeah. You don't have to tell me.

9
00:00:29,354 --> 00:00:31,654
(Raj:)So, your father-in-law
is in there right now?

10
00:00:31,656 --> 00:00:32,886
(Howard:)Yes. So back me up.

11
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:35,190
(Howard:)The house is good the way it is.
Oh, okay. Got it.

12
00:00:36,627 --> 00:00:37,957
(Howard:)Hey. What's going on?

13
00:00:37,962 --> 00:00:39,432
(Sheldon:)Hey.
Hey, Raj.

14
00:00:39,430 --> 00:00:41,960
(Bernadette:)Dad and I were just talking
about taking down this wall.

15
00:00:41,966 --> 00:00:46,736
(Raj:)You sure? It's a...
pretty great wall.

16
00:00:46,738 --> 00:00:48,468
(Mr Rostenkowski:)What's so great about it?

17
00:00:49,507 --> 00:00:51,537
(Raj:)I'm sorry.
I did what I could.

18
00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:55,750
(Bernadette:)Seriously? You brought Raj over
to take your side?

19
00:00:55,747 --> 00:00:57,417
(Howard:)Your dad's on your side.

20
00:00:57,415 --> 00:00:59,885
(Bernadette:)He's not on my side. He's doing
all the work for free.

